			"notes": "# First release :D  \n\n**Current commands:**\n- **/qcp toggle** - Toggle hud (Default - On)  \n- **/qcp get** - Get current quest coordinates  \n- **/qcp settings chat_feedback** - Toggle chat feedback (Default - Off)  \n- **/qcp settings require_compass** - Toggles if the hud only renders when holding a compass (Default - On)  \n- **/qcp settings waypoint_create** - Switches between coordinate copy and waypoint creation (Default - Copy) (Requires JourneyMap for waypoints)  \n- **/qcp debug** - Check if you are connected to Monumenta  \n- **/qcp debug force** - Toggle force enable mod even if not on Munumenta (Default - Off)"
